Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 16:28:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat: opt a repo in with a tracked .own-your-diff file

quizgate install now writes the pre-push hook into the clone's hooks dir
and a .own-your-diff marker to commit, instead of pointing core.hooksPath
at a .githooks dir the repo had to carry. quizgate sync keeps a copy on
PATH for the hook and installs the hook in opted-in clones that lack it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AQXdCnr61gd6LLv441ZXZB
